{{!-- A1's head: the cover photo, then centred titling.

The photo is the publication's own feature image and everything about it is conditional —
Ghost lets an author publish without one, and the design has no drawing for that case, so
the figure simply does not render and the titling starts the page. Same for the caption:
{{feature_image_caption}} is HTML from the editor, so it is emitted with three braces, and
an empty one must not leave a 40px band of padding behind.

`h-[min(58vh,520px)]` is the design's own height. It is viewport-relative on purpose, which
is worth knowing when reading a capture: the screenshot's window is as tall as the page, so
58vh always resolves past the 520px cap there. --}}
{{#if feature_image}}
	<figure class="border-border m-0 border-b">
		<img
			src="{{img_url feature_image size="xxl"}}"
			{{#if feature_image_alt}}alt="{{feature_image_alt}}"{{else}}alt=""{{/if}}
			fetchpriority="high"
			decoding="async"
			class="block h-[min(58vh,520px)] w-full object-cover">

		{{#if feature_image_caption}}
			<figcaption class="font-ui text-muted container py-3 text-[13px]">{{{feature_image_caption}}}</figcaption>
		{{/if}}
	</figure>
{{/if}}

<div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] px-5 pt-16 text-center md:px-8">
	{{#primary_tag}}
		<p class="font-meta text-meta text-accent tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">
			<a
				href="{{url}}"
				class="text-accent no-underline">{{name}}</a>
		</p>
	{{/primary_tag}}

	<h1
		class="font-display tracking-display mt-[22px] text-[clamp(36px,5vw,64px)] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-balance">{{title}}</h1>

	{{#if custom_excerpt}}
		<p class="font-body text-muted mx-auto mt-[22px] max-w-[52ch] text-[21px] leading-[1.5] text-pretty italic">{{custom_excerpt}}</p>
	{{/if}}

	<div class="mt-7 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
		{{#primary_author}}
			{{> "post/avatar" size="size-[34px]" textSize="text-[13px]"}}

			<a
				href="{{url}}"
				class="font-ui text-text text-sm font-semibold no-underline">{{name}}</a>
		{{/primary_author}}

		<span class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-muted uppercase">
			{{date format="DD MMM YYYY"}}
			<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
			{{reading_time seconds=(t "< 1 min read") minute=(t "1 min read") minutes=(t "% min read")}}
		</span>
	</div>
</div>
